lang_help_telemetry:
Through a small anonymous report that AutoBan sends to the developer, statistics are kept on which devices and DSM versions the package runs on. That helps with development.

Only this record is sent:
Model: {device}
DSM version: {dsm}
DSM build: {dsm_build}
AutoBan version: {version}
Architecture: {arch}
UID: {uuid}
Works: {works}

Works is included only after you choose Yes or No.

The UID is not used to identify you or your device. It only ensures that the data for an installation is counted once.
